          "docs": "<p>You can delete coupons via the <a href=\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/coupons\">coupon management</a> page of the Stripe dashboard. However, deleting a coupon does not affect any customers who have already applied the coupon; it means that new customers can’t redeem the coupon. You can also delete coupons via the API.</p>"
